 "id": "universal-sdi",
 "name": "Smash DI (SDI)",
 "part": "tech",
 "characters": "all",
 "goal": "Move out of a multi-hit attack during hitlag",
 "why": "A multi-hit attack holds you in place for its last, strongest hit. Each new smash of the control stick during hitlag moves {char} 6 units while still frozen, and one on every hit takes {char} out of the attack before that hit comes. A stick held still moves {char} once.",
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "SDI moves {char} 6 units toward the control stick for every new smash of the stick during hitlag.",
  "expect": "{opp} plays footsies, comes to its distance and attacks: another attack every try. {char}'s damage is drawn for each try. Each attack is judged after its last hit could have landed: how far SDI moved {char}, how many of its hits landed, and whether the last launched {char}.",
