  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "SDI",
    "text": [
     "On each frozen frame after the hit's own, the game moves {char} 6 units toward the control stick if it is past 70% of its reach and left the center within the last 4 frames. A stick held still counts once, and one held from before the hit not at all.",
     "Electric hits freeze the victim half as long again: Pikachu's 2-damage down smash freezes {char} 4 frames per hit, 3 of them after the hit's own."
    ],
    "show": {
