    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Out of a multi-hit",
    "text": "Pikachu's down smash hits up to 7 times: 6 weak hits hold {char} beside Pikachu, then the 7th launches. Each hit takes new SDI inputs. Smash on every hit, back to the center between, and {char} is out before the 7th. Against this attack up works for every character, out within 4 hits. One smash, or a held stick, moves {char} 6 units and no more.",
